jectory point/momentum,batch0, with stored points j<=t and W0 placeholders at future indices. This is an analytic state invariant, not a new algorithm.","id":"declaration:OracleTemplate.Muon.stateAt","source":["src_dd12a540fc285c40dd87082e","src_4fa1940db34571e3a7f7fb2d","src_a758b6d08c4ce84a4dbfc684","src_32f4ef1544cd9c20a4a237c9","src_0435e80d4823caf35ecf6eaa","src_a8b804f2afa9050968e7d456","src_0ed77349f1935197e3b6e389","src_a42b8a8d1b1a6d2a17c9142a","src_caed3c6c9a765fdcd9e319a6","src_092a32a25a04cb8a6774c840"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.trajectory_fst/preferred"],"comparison":"The first coordinate of trajectory t is t, so its sample block index really is t rather than an unconstrained counter.","id":"declaration:OracleTemplate.Muon.trajectory_fst","source":["src_dd12a540fc285c40dd87082e","src_4fa1940db34571e3a7f7fb2d","src_a758b6d08c4ce84a4dbfc684","src_32f4ef1544cd9c20a4a237c9","src_0435e80d4823caf35ecf6eaa","src_a8b804f2afa9050968e7d456","src_0ed77349f1935197e3b6e389","src_a42b8a8d1b1a6d2a17c9142a","src_caed3c6c9a765fdcd9e319a6","src_092a32a25a04cb8a6774c840"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.trajectory_measurable/preferred"],"comparison":"Joint measurability of g implies measurable point/momentum trajectory t. It uses measurability of the exact partial polar factor, without a continuous-SVD selection assumption.","id":"declaration:OracleTemplate.Muon.trajectory_measurable","source":["src_dd12a540fc285c40dd87082e","src_4fa1940db34571e3a7f7fb2d","src_a758b6d08c4ce84a4dbfc684","src_32f4ef1544cd9c20a4a237c9","src_0435e80d4823caf35ecf6eaa","src_a8b804f2afa9050968e7d456","src_0ed77349f1935197e3b6e389","src_a42b8a8d1b1a6d2a17c9142a","src_caed3c6c9a765fdcd9e319a6","src_092a32a25a04cb8a6774c840"],"verdict":"match"},{"candidate":["candidate/declaration_evidence/OracleTemplate.Muon.trajectory_prefix/preferred"],"comparison":"Equal tapes below tB yield identical